  "Scenes.Nieve.NieveAppearance.TallSkinIsPale": "The [if (snowchild) {{young ice spirit is about four feet|ice spirit is about five feet ten inches}}] tall. [Nhis] skin is a pale blue that reminds you of a frozen-over lake. Between [nhis] thighs, [nhe] sports {0}."
  "Scenes.Nieve.NieveBodyHeatTalk.GivenMadeOfSnow": "Given that Nieve is apparently made of ice, and that you're fairly warm[if (coldblooded) {, even if you're technically cold-blooded}], you wonder if the two of you getting too close could be a problem. You start to ask [nhim] if there's any danger of... \"melting\" when you're getting intimate, but you're cut off with a laugh. Nieve takes a few moments to compose [nhim]self, [nhis] voice still tinged with amusement after [nhe] does."
  "Scenes.Nieve.NieveBodyHeatTalk.MightBeMore": "[pg][say:I'll be fine, [Master]. I might be more of a winter person, but I like it when things get a bit \"heated\", too,] [nhe] says mirthfully."
  "Scenes.Nieve.NieveBodyHeatTalk.OneWorryPutRest": "[pg]Well, that's one worry put to rest, you suppose."
  "Scenes.Nieve.NieveBuilding.ApproachItAgainLooking": "You approach your [snowman] again, looking it over."
  "Scenes.Nieve.NieveBuilding.ApproachNearlyFinished": "You approach your nearly finished [snowman]. To others, it might be a perfectly acceptable creation, but not to you. It needs a carrot to finish it off."
