  "Scenes.Nieve.NieveCampDescs.SeemsToBeWorking": "Nieve seems to be working on a spear, sharpening it with a jagged piece of ice. When [nhe] catches sight of you [nhe] waves and gives a friendly smile."
  "Scenes.Nieve.NieveCampDescs.SittingAtTheEdge": "Nieve is sitting at the edge of [nhis] icy expanse, staring off at the distant mountains. You wonder if [nhe]'s looking for home."
  "Scenes.Nieve.NieveCampDescs.SittingCrossLegged": "Nieve is sitting cross-legged in the snowdrift, munching on what looks to be icicles. As you watch, [nhe] reaches down into the glittering powder surrounding [nhim] and produces another one."
  "Scenes.Nieve.NieveCampDescs.SittingCrossLeggedAgain": "Nieve is sitting cross-legged, in the middle of what appears to be an argument with a snowman [nhe]'s just made."
  "Scenes.Nieve.NieveCampDescs.SittingInTheWhite": "Nieve is sitting in the white wintry wonderland, carefully constructing a snowman. It strikes you as strange, and almost masturbatory in a way. [Nhe] spots you and gives you a wave and a smile. For a moment, you think the snowman has too, but you eventually conclude it's your imagination."
  "Scenes.Nieve.NieveCampDescs.SittingOnTopOf": "Nieve is sitting on top of a small ice fort, vigilantly watching the borders of your camp."
  "Scenes.Nieve.NieveCampDescs.SprawledOutInThe": "Nieve is sprawled out in the icy field, creating a series of snow angels without a care in the world. When [nhe] catches sight of you, [nhe] gives a friendly wave, then dives back into the snow."
  "Scenes.Nieve.NieveCampDescs.SurprisinglyOutsideCold": "Nieve is, surprisingly, outside of [nhis] cold camp. [Nhe]'s dancing along the battered, parched ground, calling down snow. Wherever a flake hits, it's immediately devoured by the thirsty earth. Is Nieve perhaps trying to... water the ground?"
  "Scenes.Nieve.NieveCampKids.AreYourChildrenAlike": "are your children, {0} alike, all having fun"
